td>4.6%<tr><th>version 6.9.5<td><td><td><td><td><td>&lt;0.1%<td>&lt;0.1%<td>&lt;0.1%<td>&lt;0.1%<td>10.8%<td>21.5%<td>23.5%<td>3.2%<td>2.7%<tr><th>version 6.9.6<td><td><td><td><td><td><td><td><td><td><td>4.3%<td>5.7%<td>0.5%<td>0.4%<tr><th>version 6.9.3<td><td><td><td><td><td>1.2%<td>1.1%<td>0.2%<td>0.2%<td>0.3%<td>0.3%<td>0.3%<td>0.2%<td>0.2%<tr><th>version 6.9.2<td><td><td><td><td>&lt;0.1%<td>0.4%<td>0.3%<td>&lt;0.1%<td>0.1%<td>0.1%<td>0.1%<td>0.1%<td>0.1%<td>0.1%</table><p>The diagram shows only WordPress versions with more than 1% usage.<br><table class=minimal><tr><td><img src="https://w3techs.com/diagram/history_details/cm-wordpress/6.9/m" alt="Historical trends in the usage statistics of WordPress version 6.9" width=900 height=500><td><div class=report_info_cont style="width:120px"><div class=report_info>Find more details in our extensive WordPress market report.<br><br><a href="https://w3techs.com/technologies/report/cm-wordpress"><b>Learn more</b></a></div></div><br clear=all><br><br><br></table><h3>Share this page</h3><ul class="share-buttons"><script>document.write("<"+"li><"+"a href='mailto:?subject="+document.title+"&body="+document.title+" - https://w3techs.com/technologies/history_details/cm-wordpress/6.9' title='Send email'><"+"img loading=lazy alt='Send email' src='https://w3techs.com/pictures/Email.svg'><"+"/a>")</script><li><a href="https://www.linkedin.com/sharing/share-offsite/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fw3techs.com%2Ftechnologies%2Fhistory_details%2Fcm-wordpress%2F6.9" title="Share on LinkedIn" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener noreferrer" onclick="window.open('https://www.linkedin.com/shareArticle?mini=true&url=https%3A%2F%2Fw3techs.com%2Ftechnologies%2Fhistory_details%2Fcm-wordpress%2F6.9', '_blank', 'width=600,height=400'); return false;"><img loading=lazy alt="Share on LinkedIn" src="https://w3techs.com/pictures/LinkedIn.svg"></a><li><a href="https://bsky.app/intent/compose?text= - https%3A%2F%2Fw3techs.com%2Ftechnologies%2Fhistory_details%2Fcm